+<p>Here we build an interactive map and html table of data science jobs across Germany. We are using one of the job posting datasets that we collect weekly by using the <a href="https://developer.adzuna.com/">Adzuna API</a> through <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>. The full script is available on my <a href="https://github.com/Flazoukie/adzuna-scraper-cleaned">GitHub Repository</a>. We collected data science-related job postings in Germany by filtering:</p>
