+<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="title-artificial-intelligence-in-healthcare-a-systematic-review-of-virtual-healthcare-assistants">Title: Artificial Intelligence in Healthcare: A Systematic Review of Virtual Healthcare Assistants</h3>
+<p>Authors: Samuel Gbli Tetteh, Lois Azupwah, Atta Yaw Agyeman, Stephen Kwasi Adjei, Ankrah Prince Twumasi, Sofo Mohammed-Nurudeen<br>
