-    "text": "AI Paper of the Week\n\n\nArtificial Intelligence in the Military Domain and Military Ethics: Key Challenges and Implications\n\n\n\nArtificial Intelligence\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJun 28, 2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWork in Progress: An Automated Workflow to Summarize and Simplify AI Research with Free Tools\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAI\n\nAutomation\n\nNLP\n\nLLMs\n\nOpen Science\n\n\n\nMy attempt to build a fully automated pipeline to fetch, simplify, and publish weekly summaries of open-access AI research using OpenAlex, Hugging Face, and GitHub Actions — entirely with free tools.\n\n\n\n\n\nJun 28, 2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWeekly Job Market Analysis - 23/06/2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJun 23, 2025\n\n\nFlavia Felletti\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHow I Automate My Data Blog to Publish Weekly with GitHub Actions\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAutomation\n\nGitHub Actions\n\nData Blog\n\n\n\nHow I automated job scraping, analysis, cross-repo publishing, and Quarto blog deployment—fully hands-free, every week.\n\n\n\n\n\nJun 20, 2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAnalysis of the Top Cities and Companies for Data Science Jobs Across Germany\n\n\n\n\n\n\njob analysis\n\npython\n\ngeodata\n\ndata visualization\n\ndata science\n\nmaps\n\n\n\n“We map the jobs across Germany and give the reader the chance to explore them through an interactive map and table” \n\n\n\n\n\nJun 15, 2025\n\n\nFlavia\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWhere Are the Data Science Jobs in Germany? 🇩🇪\n\n\n\n\n\n\nData Science\n\nJobs\n\nGermany\n\nMapping\n\n\n\nWe explore which German cities are hiring data scientists, using job listing data from the Adzuna API and visualizing the distribution using geopandas and plotly.\n\n\n\n\n\nJun 5, 2025\n\n\nFlavia Felletti\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nData Science Job Postings 2024 (Part III): What Are the Core Responsibilities in Data Science Jobs? Let’s Find Out with spaCy and NLP!\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNLP\n\nJob Market\n\nData Science\n\n\n\nUsing NLP to find out the core responsibilities of data science jobs.\n\n\n\n\n\nJun 3, 2025\n\n\nFlavia Felletti\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nData Science Job Postings 2024 (Part II): What Skills Are in Demand?\n\n\n\n\n\n\nData Science\n\nEDA\n\nSkills\n\nJob Market\n\n\n\nAnalyzing required skills from LinkedIn job postings to uncover the most sought-after tools and technologies for data professionals.\n\n\n\n\n\nMay 20, 2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nData Science Job Postings 2024 (Part I)\n\n\n\n\n\n\nData Science\n\nEDA\n\nJob Market\n\n\n\nA hands-on walkthrough using a LinkedIn-based dataset to clean and explore job titles, companies, and locations.\n\n\n\n\n\nMay 20, 2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHow to Download Datasets from Kaggle Using kagglehub\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPython\n\nData\n\nTools\n\n\n\nA step-by-step guide to downloading Kaggle datasets with the new kagglehub Python package.\n\n\n\n\n\nMay 15, 2025\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHow to Create a Blog Using Quarto\n\n\n\n\n\n\ntutorial\n\nquarto\n\ngithub\n\nblogging\n\n\n\nLearn how to set up your own stylish data blog using Quarto and GitHub Pages — no advanced web skills required.\n\n\n\n\n\nMay 11, 2025\n\n\nFlavia Felletti\n\n\n\n\n\nNo matching items"
